Client — OpenAI(api_key=os.environ.get("OPENAI_API_KEY"), base_url=os.environ.get("OPENAI_API_BASE")).

translate_to_language(text: str, language: str) -> str — exact name and both required parameters.

Parameterized prompt — both {text} and {language} are interpolated; language is passed as "Spanish and French" so the single call asks for both translations.

API parameters — model="gpt-5.6-luna", messages=[{"role": "user", "content": prompt}], max_tokens=100, temperature=0.7.

Print — output stored in response, then print(response) outputs the Spanish & French translations.

