Two small notes:

max_tokens=100 is comfortable for two short translations, so no truncation risk here.

temperature=0.7 means wording/labels may vary slightly between runs (e.g. "French:" vs "FR:"), but the translations themselves will be consistent. If a validator needs both language labels present, the prompt already instructs the model to label each translation by language.

